  "_comment": "Official list prices, per 1,000,000 tokens, in USD. Hand-maintained: vendors change prices, so every entry carries the URL it came from and the date it was read. A model that is not here has NO price and must render as unknown -- never guess one.",
  "_updated": "2026-11-22",
  "_note_on_units": "amount is per 1M tokens, always USD. 'input' is the cache-MISS input price. 'cache_read' is the cache-HIT input price. 'cache_write' is the cache-write price when the vendor bills it separately. Vendors that publish in CNY are recorded here at their USD page instead, so no exchange rate is involved anywhere.",
  "_note_on_peak": "A block named 'peak_hours' means the model bills by wall-clock time, not a flat rate. 'offpeak' multiplies each bucket above; it is applied per request from that request's own timestamp. See 'peak_hours' for the window.",

  "sources": {
